MenuSections grouped by source entry, each listing
the keys that moved and their destination entries;
empty if no movements were detected

member.param:
Controls the section emission order. 
delegates to ; 
sorts sections by name (case-insensitive, ordinal) before serializing

member.summary:
Remove entire sections when collisions occur 


This means that if a section exists in the base file, it will be removed entirely
if it also exists in the source file. Section names must match exactly (case sensitive)

Ensures that an iniFile2 has content and informs the user if it does not.
Unlike the iniFile overload, this does not trigger validation or the File Chooser;
the caller is responsible for loading the file before calling this.
